@startuml state_diagram

skinparam state {
    BackgroundColor #DDEEFF
    BorderColor     #3366AA
    FontStyle       bold
}

note "WorkflowStatus values mirror the GitHub Actions API.\nConclusion is only meaningful when status = COMPLETED." as N1

[*] --> QUEUED : add_workflow_run()

QUEUED      : Run is waiting\nfor a runner

REQUESTED   : Workflow has been\ntriggered and is\nawaiting scheduling

PENDING     : Run is pending\na prerequisite

WAITING     : Waiting on a concurrency\ngroup or deployment\nprotection rule

IN_PROGRESS : Runner is actively\nexecuting the workflow

COMPLETED   : Run has finished\n─────────────────────\nconclusion:\n  SUCCESS | FAILURE | CANCELLED\n  TIMED_OUT | SKIPPED\n  ACTION_REQUIRED | NEUTRAL | STALE

QUEUED      --> IN_PROGRESS : runner picks up
QUEUED      --> WAITING     : concurrency blocked
QUEUED      --> PENDING     : prerequisite missing
REQUESTED   --> QUEUED      : scheduled by runner
PENDING     --> IN_PROGRESS : prerequisite cleared
WAITING     --> IN_PROGRESS : concurrency lock acquired
IN_PROGRESS --> COMPLETED   : run finishes

COMPLETED   --> [*]

@enduml
